--   Recorded as one entry rather than forty-eight. Both 119th Senate vote menus were
--   swept for joint-resolution rolls before any candidate was chosen, to be sure no
--   admissible passage vote was being missed on a key in the census. Every roll the
--   sweep turned up beyond the two admitted here carries a 'Motion to Proceed', 'On the
