-- · H.Con.Res. 14 (senate 119/1 Scott (FL) Amdt. 3113, 15-81 Rejected) — REFUSED on rule
--   11. Fifteen yeas against eighty-one nays separates a fragment from a chamber, not
--   one side from another. Recorded because econ_smallbiz is the third-highest-ranked
--   hole in the census and this is the only Senate instrument on it.
-- · the NDAA (senate 119/1 S.Amdt. 3872, admissible on form) — DECLINED FOR A DIFFERENT
--   REASON, recorded because it was a live candidate. The instrument is admissible and
--   contested, but its key is guard_authority, which sits in _RD_NO_POLE in
--   stance-helpers.js — the engine will never characterise it. A PRIMARY there moves no
