--   a wave that reports a number instead of an improvement. Same reason S. 1582
--   (crypto_cbdc) and H.Con.Res. 86 (war_powers) were dropped from the candidate slate:
--   all three keys are in _RD_NO_POLE. Recorded so the next wave does not rediscover
--   them as opportunities.
